
. * Stata oracle for selection, weights, subpop, and category presentation.
. clear

. set more off

. input double x y w s

              x          y          w          s
  1. 1 1 .5 1
  2. 1 2 2 0
  3. 2 1 3 .
  4. 2 2 0 0
  5. 3 . 4 1
  6. . 1 1 1
  7. end

